WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.340 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 11=

01:40.740 --> 01:42.140
(Cuiyun Tower)
Sir, come in and have some fun!

01:43.860 --> 01:45.060
Sir! Come inside and...

01:47.260 --> 01:48.820
What did Yang Si say earlier?

01:49.140 --> 01:49.780
Take care, sir!

01:49.780 --> 01:51.300
Seducing the Princess

01:51.860 --> 01:53.940
while sneaking off to brothels
behind her back?

01:55.460 --> 01:56.180
My dear Yan Shang.

01:56.180 --> 01:57.140
Sir, please come in!

01:57.460 --> 02:00.140
I had no idea you
were trying to seduce me.

02:05.860 --> 02:06.780
Am I seeing things?

02:07.660 --> 02:08.580
You're blushing.

02:09.660 --> 02:10.340
What's on your mind?

02:13.100 --> 02:15.180
What were you thinking about just now,
Your Highness?

02:19.460 --> 02:19.940
Tonight,

02:20.740 --> 02:22.100
I noticed something interesting.

02:22.900 --> 02:23.900
Outside a private room upstairs,

02:24.540 --> 02:26.420
several men were pretending
to chat casually.

02:26.980 --> 02:28.140
But I recognized their bearing.

02:28.620 --> 02:29.980
They were clearly soldiers,

02:30.780 --> 02:32.340
probably from the frontier army.

02:35.620 --> 02:36.380
Then that private room

02:36.780 --> 02:38.540
probably held a high-ranking officer
in disguise.

02:41.140 --> 02:42.140
Even more interestingly,

02:42.740 --> 02:44.900
Yang Si entered that room too.

02:49.940 --> 02:50.740
I have a theory,

02:51.340 --> 02:52.580
but I can't verify it just yet.

02:53.380 --> 02:55.100
Perhaps I'll get the chance later.

02:57.140 --> 03:01.900
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

03:01.900 --> 03:02.940
Has Yan Shang gone to see
the exam results?

03:03.500 --> 03:04.140
Not yet.

03:05.580 --> 03:07.020
He certainly has patience.

03:08.660 --> 03:09.820
Yan Shang isn't worried,

03:09.820 --> 03:10.540
but you seem to be.

03:13.900 --> 03:14.700
Forgive me, Your Highness.

03:15.860 --> 03:17.020
Why would I be worried?

03:18.460 --> 03:19.740
Even if luck isn't on his side,

03:20.460 --> 03:22.020
I still have Wei Shu,
the future top scholar.

03:22.940 --> 03:23.820
That's different.

03:24.620 --> 03:26.140
If Wei Shu failed the exams,

03:26.420 --> 03:28.540
you wouldn't go out in the middle
of the night looking for a solution.

03:29.660 --> 03:30.580
Chunhua.

03:31.020 --> 03:32.140
Are you asking for a beating?

03:34.660 --> 03:35.900
Wei Shu won't fail.

03:38.780 --> 03:39.220
Your Highness,

03:40.020 --> 03:41.860
if you're really so curious
about the results,

03:42.100 --> 03:43.180
why don't I go check for you?

03:46.180 --> 03:46.740
Tell me.

03:48.060 --> 03:49.020
Why do you want to see the results?

03:51.300 --> 03:52.420
Liu Wenji said

03:52.740 --> 03:53.620
if he passes the exams,

03:54.020 --> 03:54.580
he'll marry me.

03:56.740 --> 03:57.060
Go on.

03:59.580 --> 04:00.220
Thank you, Your Highness.

04:06.460 --> 04:07.020
(Chunhua,)

04:07.740 --> 04:08.860
(I'm afraid your wedding)

04:09.940 --> 04:10.940
(will have to wait a little longer.)

04:14.140 --> 04:15.300
(Examination Hall)
(I passed! I passed!)

04:15.340 --> 04:15.900
(Imperial Examination Results)
(Come take a look!)

04:16.100 --> 04:17.780
(I made the list! There's my name!)

04:17.940 --> 04:19.580
(Thirteen, Mr. Bai! Thirteen!)

04:20.340 --> 04:21.180
(I didn't pass.)

04:21.460 --> 04:22.300
(Excellent! Well done!)

04:22.740 --> 04:23.500
(We all made the list!)

04:23.500 --> 04:24.020
I made the list!

04:24.020 --> 04:24.700
(Not bad! Well done!)

04:24.700 --> 04:25.460
I made the list!

04:25.900 --> 04:27.420
I passed!

04:29.180 --> 04:29.740
(Sixteen!)

04:29.740 --> 04:30.260
(I passed!)

04:30.460 --> 04:30.940
(We all made it!)

04:30.940 --> 04:31.580
(I passed!)

04:31.580 --> 04:32.140
(We all made it!)

04:32.140 --> 04:33.100
(I passed!)

04:36.620 --> 04:36.980
(Wei Shu!)

04:37.100 --> 04:37.900
- (Wei Shu came first!)
- (Look!)

04:37.900 --> 04:38.260
(Wei Shu!)

04:38.500 --> 04:39.140
(2nd: Li Wenqing; 3rd: Yan Shang)
(Who's Wei Shu?)

04:39.860 --> 04:40.860
(1st: Wei Shu)
(That's Wei Shu!)

04:40.860 --> 04:41.900
(1st: Wei Shu)

04:42.500 --> 04:43.300
- (Congratulations!)
- (Congratulations, Wei Shu!)

04:43.300 --> 04:43.980
(Congratulations! Congratulations!)

04:44.220 --> 04:45.140
- (Congratulations!)
- (Congratulations, Wei Shu!)

04:45.140 --> 04:46.260
(Congratulations, Wei Shu!)

04:46.260 --> 04:47.460
- (Such a brilliant young scholar!)
- (Congratulations, Wei Shu!)

04:47.460 --> 04:48.300
- (Incredible!)
- (Wei Shu!)

04:48.300 --> 04:49.220
- (Congratulations!)
- (Wei Shu!)

04:49.220 --> 04:49.820
(Amazing, Wei Shu!)

04:49.820 --> 04:50.540
(Congratulations, Wei Shu!)

04:50.540 --> 04:52.380
- (Wei Shu!)
- (Wei Shu, congratulations!)

04:52.500 --> 04:53.220
(Congratulations!)

04:53.380 --> 04:53.740
(Wei Shu!)

04:54.300 --> 04:54.700
(Wei Shu!)

04:57.100 --> 04:58.100
(Examination Hall)

04:58.100 --> 04:59.100
(You owe us all a feast!)

04:59.660 --> 05:00.580
(Wei Shu! Wait!)

05:02.460 --> 05:02.940
(Wei Shu.)

05:02.940 --> 05:04.020
(Congratulations, Wei Shu!)

05:10.860 --> 05:12.580
(I'm number eighteen! I passed too!)

05:12.820 --> 05:13.740
(Am I number seventeen?)

05:14.900 --> 05:15.820
(I passed too!)

05:16.820 --> 05:17.660
(I passed!)

05:20.060 --> 05:20.820
(Let me help you look.)

05:23.220 --> 05:25.220
(Examination Hall)

05:28.260 --> 05:29.300
(Better luck next year!)

05:33.740 --> 05:38.380
(1st: Wei Shu; 2nd: Li Wenqing;
3rd: Yan Shang; 4th: Wen Qingchen)

05:40.700 --> 05:42.700
(Examination Hall)

05:44.780 --> 05:45.580
Satisfied now?

05:47.580 --> 05:47.980
Thank you.

05:48.580 --> 05:49.220
Where's Guiniang?

05:50.460 --> 05:51.260
Give her back to me!

05:51.980 --> 05:52.660
I've lost everything.

05:52.660 --> 05:53.500
She's all I have left.

05:54.940 --> 05:55.420
Feng Xianyu,

05:56.580 --> 05:57.380
she...

05:57.980 --> 05:59.500
returned home with an old servant
yesterday.

06:00.260 --> 06:02.140
Didn't you personally see her off
at the city gate?

06:05.100 --> 06:06.220
(May the Realm Prosper)
What I said last night...

06:06.860 --> 06:07.660
I was bluffing.

06:08.340 --> 06:09.260
Guiniang is safe.

06:12.460 --> 06:13.420
You lied to me?

06:14.900 --> 06:15.260
Yes.

06:22.620 --> 06:23.700
I can't believe I fell for it.

06:28.140 --> 06:29.500
My guilty conscience

06:31.700 --> 06:33.220
made me fall for your trick.

06:34.980 --> 06:35.380
Feng Xianyu.

06:39.140 --> 06:40.340
What else do you have to say?

06:41.620 --> 06:42.580
Are you going to mock me

06:43.100 --> 06:43.980
or lecture me?

06:48.860 --> 06:51.140
Grand Princess Luling
always tires of her lovers.

06:51.340 --> 06:52.140
A man who relies on his looks

06:52.980 --> 06:54.020
can never keep her favor for long.

06:54.260 --> 06:56.060
And how is Princess Danyang
any different?

06:57.020 --> 06:58.620
How long will you and Wei Shu
stay in her favor?

06:59.380 --> 07:00.140
You have talent

07:00.660 --> 07:01.340
and ambition.

07:02.340 --> 07:04.180
Instead of flattering others
to win their favor,

07:05.180 --> 07:07.140
use your intelligence and abilities

07:07.820 --> 07:08.780
to earn your place in her household.

07:10.300 --> 07:13.300
Grand Princess Luling has wielded
unchecked power in Sheng'an for years.

07:13.820 --> 07:16.300
Yet she has few wise advisers
to guide her.

07:16.940 --> 07:17.860
She hasn't even secured a way out.

07:18.900 --> 07:20.260
If the political winds shift one day,

07:21.420 --> 07:22.780
she may not even
be able to save herself.

07:24.940 --> 07:26.060
We were classmates once.

07:27.780 --> 07:28.620
That's all I'll say.

07:30.260 --> 07:32.900
(May the Realm Prosper)

07:35.140 --> 07:36.900
(Examination Hall)
(Is my name there? Can you see it?)

07:38.940 --> 07:40.340
(How am I supposed to explain this?)

07:41.300 --> 07:42.300
(Am I number seventeen?)

07:42.300 --> 07:42.900
(I passed too!)

07:43.660 --> 07:44.180
(That's me!)

07:45.260 --> 07:46.060
(I passed!)

07:47.580 --> 07:48.740
(Why isn't his name there?)

07:48.940 --> 07:49.460
Yan Shang!

07:50.140 --> 07:50.900
Miss Chunhua.

07:51.580 --> 07:52.620
Is Her Highness here too?

07:53.540 --> 07:55.060
She's waiting for news at the residence.

07:55.300 --> 07:55.980
I came alone.

07:58.020 --> 07:58.540
Yan Shang,

07:58.980 --> 07:59.980
have you seen Liu Wenji?

08:00.660 --> 08:02.060
I've been waiting by the results board
all morning.

08:03.020 --> 08:04.580
But I couldn't find his name
on the list,

08:05.260 --> 08:06.140
and I haven't seen him either.

08:07.020 --> 08:07.860
I haven't seen him either.

08:08.700 --> 08:09.780
But Wenji would certainly come.

08:10.420 --> 08:11.060
I'm afraid

08:11.620 --> 08:12.620
he may have already seen the results

08:12.900 --> 08:13.660
and slipped away quietly.

08:14.380 --> 08:15.340
He might be avoiding us.

08:16.580 --> 08:17.540
Why would he avoid me?

08:19.620 --> 08:20.460
If he's upset,

08:20.460 --> 08:21.420
I could keep him company.

08:23.300 --> 08:24.500
He must feel terrible being alone.

08:26.180 --> 08:26.900
Where could he have gone?

08:28.940 --> 08:29.660
Miss Chunhua,

08:30.300 --> 08:30.900
don't worry.

08:31.380 --> 08:32.180
I'll help you find him.

08:32.700 --> 08:33.620
You check Yongshou Temple.

08:34.140 --> 08:35.020
I'll look elsewhere.

08:38.380 --> 08:41.220
(Examination Hall)

08:41.460 --> 08:43.140
All that effort, for nothing!

08:43.380 --> 08:44.500
What's the point of all this studying?

08:44.500 --> 08:45.340
(Congratulations, sir!)

08:45.780 --> 08:46.220
(Thank you!)

08:46.900 --> 08:48.700
- (Your writing is truly exceptional!)
- (You've made a name for yourself!)

08:48.900 --> 08:49.260
(Look!)

08:50.060 --> 08:50.860
(You must be so relieved!)

08:50.860 --> 08:51.300
(Failed again!)

08:51.300 --> 08:52.220
- (Failed again!)
- (I'm done with these exams!)

08:54.100 --> 08:55.380
Sorry, I mistook you for someone else.

09:10.500 --> 09:11.500
(I want another drink!)

09:12.140 --> 09:12.900
(All right, all right!)

09:13.580 --> 09:13.900
(Here!)

09:14.820 --> 09:15.420
(Failed again!)

09:21.100 --> 09:21.620
Waiter!

09:22.820 --> 09:24.340
Bring me your finest wine.

09:25.940 --> 09:27.180
I... I can pay!

09:38.100 --> 09:40.700
What's the fun in drinking alone?

09:41.060 --> 09:43.740
Why not let the two of us
keep you company?

09:45.860 --> 09:46.140
Get lost!

09:48.860 --> 09:50.100
Why get so angry, sir?

09:50.420 --> 09:52.500
Life is full of disappointments.

09:52.780 --> 09:54.580
Let us drink with you tonight

09:54.900 --> 09:55.820
and help you forget your troubles.

09:58.260 --> 09:59.060
Forget my troubles?

10:01.420 --> 10:02.780
You women of the pleasure house...

10:04.340 --> 10:06.540
What could you possibly
know of my sorrow?

10:15.340 --> 10:15.900
Then again...

10:18.300 --> 10:19.420
On a day like today,

10:20.740 --> 10:22.700
they're all celebrating their success.

10:24.300 --> 10:25.300
Apart from you two,

10:27.420 --> 10:29.180
who else could help me drown my sorrows?

10:31.420 --> 10:32.140
All right!

10:32.700 --> 10:34.300
Waiter! More wine!

10:38.780 --> 10:39.820
We've searched everywhere
we can think of.

10:40.140 --> 10:41.060
What if he does something foolish?

10:44.940 --> 10:45.340
Chunhua.

10:46.060 --> 10:46.660
You should head back.

10:46.940 --> 10:47.700
I'll keep looking.

10:48.020 --> 10:48.620
If I find any trace of him,

10:48.900 --> 10:49.500
I'll let you know.

10:50.220 --> 10:50.500
All right.

10:58.140 --> 10:59.420
Where will Yan Shang look for him?

11:04.580 --> 11:05.260
(I'm done with these exams!)

11:05.260 --> 11:05.660
(Unbelievable!)

11:05.660 --> 11:09.820
(Cuiyun Tower)

11:09.820 --> 11:10.660
Sir, you're back!

11:11.340 --> 11:13.420
Why isn't your wife with you this time?

11:13.700 --> 11:14.300
At a time like this,

11:14.540 --> 11:16.140
I imagine you have plenty of scholars
who failed the exams.

11:16.180 --> 11:16.860
(Zuiyue Tower)
More than you can count!

11:17.100 --> 11:18.260
It's the same every year
when the results come out.

11:20.060 --> 11:20.380
(Cuiyun Tower)
Right this way.

11:20.740 --> 11:21.900
(Careful, sir.)

11:21.900 --> 11:22.740
Watch your step.

11:23.460 --> 11:23.900
(Okay.)

11:24.900 --> 11:25.820
Pretty lady.

11:26.220 --> 11:26.860
Have a drink with me.

11:29.020 --> 11:30.020
- (Easy.)
- (Drink with me.)

11:36.060 --> 11:36.940
Excuse me. Coming through.

11:37.740 --> 11:38.420
(Careful.)

11:40.700 --> 11:41.660
(Come on! Let's drink!)

11:46.980 --> 11:48.420
(You can really hold your liquor.)

11:49.220 --> 11:50.020
(Have another!)

11:52.300 --> 11:55.140
(Sir, there's still plenty
left in your cup.)

11:55.340 --> 11:55.660
(Here.)

11:57.980 --> 11:58.380
Who is it?

11:58.820 --> 12:00.420
(Who's that?)

12:05.900 --> 12:07.060
Well, if it isn't our
third-place scholar.

12:07.540 --> 12:08.060
Liu Wenji.

12:09.100 --> 12:11.660
I'll pretend you're just talking
nonsense because you're drunk.

12:12.500 --> 12:12.860
What?

12:14.180 --> 12:14.820
Am I wrong?

12:16.380 --> 12:16.940
Aren't you

12:18.740 --> 12:19.900
the Third-Place Scholar?

12:21.060 --> 12:21.700
Isn't he?

12:22.820 --> 12:23.140
Come on.

12:23.580 --> 12:24.100
You're coming back with me.

12:24.460 --> 12:25.060
I'm not leaving.

12:25.700 --> 12:27.260
I'm having a wonderful time here.

12:34.820 --> 12:35.780
If Chunhua saw you like this,

12:36.620 --> 12:38.380
imagine how much it would hurt her.

12:48.220 --> 12:49.020
Chunhua?

12:54.820 --> 12:55.620
I can't marry her.

12:58.300 --> 12:59.460
Whether I pass the exams or not,

13:00.980 --> 13:01.780
I can never marry her.

13:06.420 --> 13:06.900
Come on.

13:07.940 --> 13:08.660
Have a drink with me.

13:13.300 --> 13:13.820
Liu Wenji!

13:27.340 --> 13:27.940
Liu Wenji.

13:29.260 --> 13:30.780
I waited for you by the results board
all day.

13:32.340 --> 13:34.020
And you came to this filthy place?

13:37.020 --> 13:37.380
Wenji.

13:44.700 --> 13:45.060
Wenji.

13:49.540 --> 13:50.180
Filthy?

14:09.700 --> 14:10.500
Filthy?

14:15.940 --> 14:16.660
Filthy?

14:21.500 --> 14:21.820
That's right.

14:23.980 --> 14:25.380
I'm just like this place now.

14:26.420 --> 14:27.540
A disgrace to everyone!

14:28.140 --> 14:28.620
Wenji.

14:29.500 --> 14:30.820
Chunhua's just worried about you.
She didn't...

14:33.460 --> 14:34.100
Back in Lingnan,

14:35.540 --> 14:37.380
every one of you called me a genius.

14:38.700 --> 14:40.060
You all said I was brilliant.

14:41.340 --> 14:42.020
You even said

14:43.020 --> 14:44.420
I deserved every word of praise.

14:47.460 --> 14:49.260
I studied so hard.

14:50.380 --> 14:51.180
And what did it get me?

14:54.020 --> 14:54.580
What did it get me?

14:56.300 --> 14:57.380
You've all risen to greatness,

14:57.940 --> 14:58.860
basking in glory.

15:00.220 --> 15:01.580
And I failed miserably,

15:02.860 --> 15:04.460
bringing shame upon my family.

15:09.780 --> 15:11.260
How could I possibly
be worthy of your company?

15:21.660 --> 15:22.060
Chunhua.

15:25.340 --> 15:26.620
You must be terribly disappointed in me.

15:32.500 --> 15:32.940
Look.

15:35.900 --> 15:37.460
I can see it in your eyes.

15:39.540 --> 15:40.740
Nothing but pity,

15:42.900 --> 15:44.060
disappointment,

15:46.580 --> 15:47.460
and confusion.

15:53.700 --> 15:54.180
Oh, I forgot.

15:56.500 --> 15:58.540
One of you is a third-place scholar.

15:59.540 --> 16:00.140
The other

16:00.740 --> 16:02.020
is merely a servant,

16:02.860 --> 16:04.980
but has the princess's favor.

16:05.980 --> 16:07.580
No wonder you both look down on me.

16:14.100 --> 16:15.820
What do you mean, "merely a servant"?

16:18.140 --> 16:18.780
Liu Wenji.

16:20.180 --> 16:21.860
Is that really how you see me?

16:23.860 --> 16:24.300
Chunhua.

16:25.060 --> 16:26.140
He's had a terrible day.

16:26.660 --> 16:27.340
He's drunk.

16:27.940 --> 16:28.300
Wenji.

16:28.500 --> 16:29.780
Spare me your empty sympathy.

16:31.020 --> 16:32.100
You came rushing over

16:32.580 --> 16:33.740
just to laugh at me, didn't you?

16:34.940 --> 16:35.380
Yan Shang.

16:36.260 --> 16:37.660
What gives you the right to mock me?

16:39.340 --> 16:40.900
You always act so high and mighty,

16:41.340 --> 16:43.500
yet you'd even stoop to becoming
the princess's male favorite

16:43.500 --> 16:44.260
just to gain her favor.

16:45.140 --> 16:47.700
I, Liu Wenji, would never associate
with the likes of you.

16:47.700 --> 16:48.220
And you.

16:51.180 --> 16:52.740
If you'd been willing to help me

16:52.980 --> 16:55.260
and put in a good word for me
with the princess,

16:55.820 --> 16:57.700
why should I alone have no one
to recommend me?

16:57.900 --> 16:59.420
Why would I be the only one who failed?

17:23.980 --> 17:24.460
Wenji.

17:30.460 --> 17:31.300
Once you're sober,

17:32.420 --> 17:33.260
I'll come find you again.

17:34.220 --> 17:35.220
I only hope that by then,

17:38.220 --> 17:39.380
Chunhua will still be willing
to see you.

18:05.300 --> 18:06.460
There, there.

18:06.740 --> 18:08.060
Look at you, poor thing.

18:08.860 --> 18:10.020
Even back in North Jing,

18:10.580 --> 18:11.900
I never saw you cry this much.

18:13.020 --> 18:14.140
You didn't see

18:15.060 --> 18:16.460
the way he behaved.

18:17.020 --> 18:18.020
Good thing I didn't!

18:19.300 --> 18:21.220
Otherwise, I'd have beaten him
half to death!

18:22.020 --> 18:23.780
You and Yan Shang shouldn't
have gone looking for him.

18:24.500 --> 18:25.340
Let him drink himself to death

18:25.940 --> 18:27.100
and rot in that brothel!

18:27.260 --> 18:27.900
It's not like that.

18:29.700 --> 18:31.220
He was just so upset.

18:32.940 --> 18:34.780
That's why he said such awful things.

18:35.500 --> 18:36.220
And you're not upset?

18:36.660 --> 18:37.580
Yet you're still defending him.

18:39.300 --> 18:41.740
Countless scholars
fail the imperial exams.

18:42.020 --> 18:43.460
But I've rarely seen anyone
behave like him,

18:44.580 --> 18:46.540
lashing out at his friend
and the woman he loves!

18:47.500 --> 18:48.140
The way I see it,

18:48.780 --> 18:50.140
he's been a spoiled young master
for too long.

18:50.540 --> 18:51.420
Deep down,

18:51.620 --> 18:53.300
he's never seen Yan Shang or you

18:53.620 --> 18:55.100
as his equals.

18:56.220 --> 18:57.020
Now that he's failed,

18:57.500 --> 18:58.660
his pride has given way to insecurity,

18:58.980 --> 18:59.860
and he's taking it out on everyone.

19:07.180 --> 19:08.660
There, there. It's all right.

19:11.340 --> 19:12.100
There, now.

19:12.940 --> 19:14.460
Stop crying. It's all right.

19:15.700 --> 19:17.340
Get some proper rest here today.

19:17.740 --> 19:18.540
Have something to eat.

19:19.540 --> 19:20.700
We'll worry about tomorrow
when it comes.

19:27.380 --> 19:28.260
(Imperial Academy)
Excellent!

19:29.060 --> 19:30.340
Wonderful! Wonderful!

19:31.660 --> 19:33.420
You've taken first place
in the imperial exams.

19:33.660 --> 19:34.940
You have a brilliant future
ahead of you.

19:35.620 --> 19:36.420
Shu,

19:37.060 --> 19:38.100
I know

19:38.700 --> 19:41.900
you're not the sort to repay kindness
with ingratitude.

19:42.540 --> 19:43.700
Your success today

19:44.020 --> 19:44.780
owes a great deal

19:45.140 --> 19:48.420
to all the guidance and support
I've given you over the years.

19:56.420 --> 19:57.740
I'm talking to you!

20:00.980 --> 20:01.380
Master.

20:02.540 --> 20:03.860
What's on your mind?

20:05.420 --> 20:05.860
Master.

20:07.660 --> 20:08.580
I have an appointment

20:09.540 --> 20:10.700
with Princess Danyang tonight.

20:11.780 --> 20:12.460
If I don't leave now,

20:12.980 --> 20:13.820
I'm afraid I'll be late.

20:14.660 --> 20:15.180
Of course!

20:15.940 --> 20:16.300
Go!

20:16.980 --> 20:17.380
Hurry along!

20:18.860 --> 20:19.220
Then,

20:20.260 --> 20:21.260
I'll take my leave.

20:21.660 --> 20:21.980
Go on!

20:25.020 --> 20:25.980
I knew it.

20:26.740 --> 20:28.420
You won't let me down.

20:30.860 --> 20:32.300
The daughter of Yaoguang Star

20:33.380 --> 20:34.860
can bring glory to the royal house.

20:37.780 --> 20:39.140
A daughter of my Li family

20:40.260 --> 20:41.900
must not be given away to an outsider!

20:47.100 --> 20:48.420
Tonight's banquet

20:48.540 --> 20:50.020
is to celebrate both of your successes.

20:55.020 --> 20:56.180
Stop looking so miserable!

20:56.820 --> 20:57.660
Cheer up!

21:01.260 --> 21:02.340
That looks so fake!

21:02.940 --> 21:04.020
Don't smile, then.

21:08.180 --> 21:08.660
Wei Shu,

21:09.500 --> 21:10.940
you came first in the entire
imperial exam.

21:11.380 --> 21:12.500
Why do you look so sad?

21:13.780 --> 21:14.260
Yan Shang,

21:15.420 --> 21:17.420
remember the night before the exams?

21:18.660 --> 21:20.100
The four of us drank tea under the moon

21:20.540 --> 21:21.740
and vowed to be lifelong friends.

21:23.140 --> 21:24.100
Yet in the blink of an eye,

21:25.260 --> 21:26.380
only the two of us remain.

21:27.420 --> 21:28.500
Life is unpredictable,

21:29.180 --> 21:30.020
and our paths often diverge.

21:31.020 --> 21:33.060
We're fortunate enough
to have shared part of the journey.

21:33.660 --> 21:35.340
We can't force the rest.

21:40.420 --> 21:41.420
Then let's raise a cup

21:41.900 --> 21:42.700
to you two fellow travelers.

21:56.820 --> 21:59.100
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

22:00.500 --> 22:04.450
♪The midsummer breeze blows soft;
Fireflies dance through the night♪

22:04.450 --> 22:08.940
♪The midsummer breeze blows soft;
Fireflies dance through the night♪

22:11.980 --> 22:12.580
Wei Shu.

22:14.100 --> 22:14.580
Wei Shu.

22:17.020 --> 22:19.100
You'll catch a chill
if you sleep out here.

22:20.900 --> 22:21.300
Wei Shu.

22:26.140 --> 22:30.940
♪Life is but a fleeting stay; How lucky
I am to walk this path with you♪

22:30.940 --> 22:31.420
Your Highness,

22:32.900 --> 22:33.900
I'm feeling a little sleepy.

22:36.020 --> 22:37.060
It's getting late.

22:37.580 --> 22:38.340
Tonight,

22:38.820 --> 22:40.340
you can stay here at my residence.

22:43.260 --> 22:50.060
♪I thought time might stand still;
Forever at that crossroads♪

22:50.060 --> 22:50.940
Thank you, Your Highness.

22:52.140 --> 22:52.740
Careful, Your Highness.

22:52.740 --> 22:58.140
♪Watching flowers bloom and fade;
Weathering life's rise and fall♪

22:58.140 --> 22:58.500
Your Highness,

22:59.460 --> 23:00.980
thank you for securing my rightful place
in the exam results.

23:01.300 --> 23:02.620
There's no need to thank me.

23:03.180 --> 23:06.260
You earned it back
through your own efforts.

23:07.060 --> 23:08.020
Then thank you

23:08.700 --> 23:09.380
for coming to tell me that day.

23:13.580 --> 23:13.900
Your Highness.

23:19.380 --> 23:20.620
Your Highness, you're drunk too.

23:21.260 --> 23:22.340
Let me take you back to your room.

23:23.460 --> 23:25.060
It's not often we have something
to celebrate.

23:25.420 --> 23:26.500
When there's cause for celebration,

23:26.980 --> 23:28.540
we ought to have a few more drinks.

23:29.140 --> 23:31.060
Life is but a hundred years.

23:31.780 --> 23:33.260
How often do we get

23:33.700 --> 23:35.180
the chance to drink
to our hearts' content

23:35.940 --> 23:37.060
and celebrate something truly wonderful?

23:44.540 --> 23:46.060
Yan Shang,

23:47.420 --> 23:48.500
tell me,

23:49.460 --> 23:51.620
are you just ridiculously lucky,

23:52.460 --> 23:54.500
or did you stumble into success
without even trying?

23:55.380 --> 23:56.300
You came to Sheng'an

23:56.660 --> 23:57.820
because of Zhang Renjing.

23:58.260 --> 24:00.580
Yet you got that third-place title
handed to you...

24:01.980 --> 24:04.620
If those scholars who failed

24:05.340 --> 24:06.060
ever found out,

24:07.060 --> 24:09.420
they'd eat you alive!

24:11.780 --> 24:12.860
Then I'll have to ask Your Highness

24:13.460 --> 24:14.300
to keep my secret.

24:16.540 --> 24:17.940
I could keep your secret.

24:19.820 --> 24:20.500
But you...

24:22.540 --> 24:23.340
So,

24:24.140 --> 24:25.340
how will you thank me?

24:31.220 --> 24:32.260
Whatever Your Highness wishes.

24:34.340 --> 24:36.860
Then I'll have to give it some thought.

24:38.300 --> 24:43.180
♪Be the ferry where you wait
for the sun♪

24:43.940 --> 24:45.060
Why are you pulling away?

24:45.740 --> 24:48.620
Can you really not stand
even a hint of wine?

24:52.820 --> 24:58.900
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

25:01.420 --> 25:01.940
Yes.

25:03.500 --> 25:04.540
Your Highness is too close.

25:05.940 --> 25:06.340
I'm...

25:08.100 --> 25:09.060
about to lose my senses.

25:12.540 --> 25:19.220
♪- Through trails of mud and blood
- Let grief drown in your eyes♪

25:22.180 --> 25:23.300
I don't believe you.

25:24.540 --> 25:27.460
Everything you say is a lie.

25:29.060 --> 25:30.740
You tricked Zhang Renjing to his death

25:31.780 --> 25:33.620
and made Feng Xianyu suffer
with your lies.

25:34.540 --> 25:39.220
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

25:39.620 --> 25:40.660
I would never lie to you.

25:41.300 --> 25:45.040
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

25:45.040 --> 25:48.940
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

25:48.980 --> 25:52.420
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

25:52.540 --> 25:56.100
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

25:56.180 --> 26:03.100
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

26:03.340 --> 26:05.220
♪- May time be free of fear
- Boats rock♪

26:05.220 --> 26:07.860
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn
- May time be free of pain♪

26:07.900 --> 26:09.420
♪You're the only one I need♪

26:09.420 --> 26:10.060
What?

26:10.820 --> 26:11.820
You're willing to drink now?

26:13.660 --> 26:14.060
Your Highness,

26:15.740 --> 26:16.580
I can't hold my liquor.

26:17.660 --> 26:18.420
Even a drop makes me drunk.

26:20.140 --> 26:24.300
But tonight...

26:24.300 --> 26:25.140
I'd like to have a taste.

26:32.100 --> 26:35.460
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

26:35.620 --> 26:39.100
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

26:39.260 --> 26:46.180
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world,
let's return to when we first met♪

26:46.380 --> 26:48.260
♪- May time be free of fear
- Boats rock♪

26:48.260 --> 26:50.900
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn
- May time be free of pain♪

26:50.940 --> 26:53.500
♪You're the only one I need♪

26:57.500 --> 26:58.100
Yan Shang?

26:59.620 --> 27:00.220
Yan Shang!

27:04.700 --> 27:06.820
You really can't handle a single drop.

27:09.620 --> 27:10.300
Yan Shang!

27:30.180 --> 27:31.300
With a tolerance like yours,

27:32.100 --> 27:33.140
if an enemy came after you,

27:34.060 --> 27:35.260
they wouldn't even need poison.

27:36.060 --> 27:37.700
A few drops of wine would do the trick!

27:38.340 --> 27:39.420
You can't even handle wine,

27:39.700 --> 27:40.660
yet you're so heavy!

27:53.740 --> 27:54.860
You look like skin and bones,

27:55.340 --> 27:56.140
but you weigh a ton!

27:56.980 --> 27:58.220
You're a real crafty schemer!

28:00.620 --> 28:02.140
You're always so quiet,

28:03.580 --> 28:04.460
putting up with everything.

28:05.380 --> 28:06.220
But when you're up to no good,

28:07.100 --> 28:08.340
you're full of wicked schemes.

28:14.980 --> 28:15.660
Your Highness...

28:18.980 --> 28:19.660
Wanyao.

28:21.980 --> 28:22.580
What?

28:24.180 --> 28:24.940
Wanyao.

28:44.420 --> 28:45.900
Don't be afraid, Wanyao.

28:48.980 --> 28:50.340
Don't leave me, Wanyao.

28:53.260 --> 28:58.620
♪Let me hold you
whenever the rain falls♪

28:58.740 --> 29:03.300
♪- Together we'll soar to the skies
- Together we'll turn to ashes♪

29:03.300 --> 29:05.020
♪Burning bright as a song♪

29:05.020 --> 29:08.620
♪Two shadows entwined,
a beautiful sight♪

29:08.780 --> 29:13.700
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

29:13.740 --> 29:18.540
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

29:18.580 --> 29:20.420
♪Not a single hour less♪

29:24.980 --> 29:25.500
Yan Shang.

29:27.620 --> 29:28.660
Dream a little longer.

29:30.060 --> 29:30.860
When you wake up,

29:32.540 --> 29:33.820
I won't be able to give you anything.

29:35.460 --> 29:42.340
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world,
let's return to when we first met♪

29:42.580 --> 29:44.940
♪- May time be free of fear
- Boats rock♪

29:44.940 --> 29:47.100
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn
- May time be free of pain♪

29:47.140 --> 29:49.700
♪You're the only one I need♪

29:49.740 --> 29:53.420
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

29:53.420 --> 29:56.900
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

29:56.940 --> 30:00.340
♪- Be my one and only in this world
- Be my one and only in this life♪

30:00.380 --> 30:03.820
♪My last untouched innocence♪

30:42.500 --> 30:45.060
So you've finally decided
to treat your uncle well today.

30:58.460 --> 30:59.460
Uncle, what brings you here

31:00.060 --> 31:00.780
to lecture me today?

31:01.380 --> 31:03.740
Marriage is the most important event
in a woman's life.

31:04.500 --> 31:05.740
How can I rest easy

31:06.340 --> 31:07.740
until you're properly married?

31:08.980 --> 31:09.460
Uncle,

31:10.380 --> 31:11.540
wasn't my marriage

31:11.940 --> 31:13.860
already celebrated with a grand wedding?

31:15.180 --> 31:16.820
Since you're so fond of matchmaking
for princesses,

31:17.540 --> 31:20.140
why not visit my aunt

31:20.420 --> 31:21.380
and see what she thinks?

31:22.140 --> 31:24.100
Perhaps she's eager to marry.

31:24.700 --> 31:25.340
Wanyao.

31:26.940 --> 31:27.980
I'm being serious.

31:28.860 --> 31:31.140
It's not as though I've tried
to marry you off

31:31.420 --> 31:33.620
to some old, ugly, pockmarked,
blind fool.

31:34.940 --> 31:36.340
I've been worrying myself sick

31:36.460 --> 31:37.940
trying to secure your happiness.

31:38.940 --> 31:39.780
I chose Wei Shu,

31:40.180 --> 31:42.580
a scholar blessed
with extraordinary talent.

31:43.340 --> 31:45.420
And now he's actually taken first place
in the imperial exams.

31:46.180 --> 31:48.700
Tell me, in what way
is he unworthy of you?

31:49.220 --> 31:50.100
Surely he's far better

31:50.100 --> 31:52.140
than that short-lived old geezer
you married before.

31:52.660 --> 31:53.540
You're quite right.

31:55.460 --> 31:57.020
My first marriage was for Father's sake.

31:57.700 --> 31:58.540
It seems my second

31:59.140 --> 31:59.940
will be for yours, Uncle.

32:01.860 --> 32:03.820
How is this for my sake?

32:04.700 --> 32:05.380
Wanyao,

32:05.940 --> 32:07.780
marriage, you see,

32:08.180 --> 32:11.260
is about uniting two families
for mutual benefit.

32:11.700 --> 32:13.980
It's been that way for ages.
What's wrong with that?

32:16.700 --> 32:19.340
I'd have liked to marry you
to my eldest son.

32:20.300 --> 32:23.660
But marrying within the bloodline
brings terrible misfortune.

32:25.380 --> 32:28.380
Now that Shu has topped
the imperial exams,

32:29.420 --> 32:30.460
if he marries a princess,

32:30.820 --> 32:32.220
wouldn't that be perfect for everyone?

32:32.700 --> 32:33.460
Enough, Uncle.

32:34.100 --> 32:35.540
You've said all this countless times.

32:36.580 --> 32:37.260
I understand.

32:39.180 --> 32:40.140
I have other matters to attend to today.

32:40.360 --> 32:40.860
Hey...

32:43.660 --> 32:44.780
That attitude of yours...

32:45.780 --> 32:47.780
You're exactly like your mother!

32:50.300 --> 32:51.620
What do you mean by that, Uncle?

32:52.940 --> 32:55.620
Your mother was just as determined
not to marry!

32:56.220 --> 32:58.060
I had to appeal to her sense of duty.

32:58.340 --> 33:00.140
I don't know how many times
I had to persuade her!

33:00.700 --> 33:01.460
My mother...

33:02.180 --> 33:02.860
She didn't want to marry?

33:05.580 --> 33:06.860
She was so determined
not to enter the palace

33:07.340 --> 33:09.100
that she nearly lost her life.

33:09.940 --> 33:10.500
And what happened?

33:11.100 --> 33:13.540
Your father ascended
the throne soon afterward,

33:13.900 --> 33:16.420
and the Li family rose
to unprecedented glory!

33:18.300 --> 33:19.820
Back then,

33:20.780 --> 33:22.740
if I, as her elder brother,

33:23.220 --> 33:24.100
hadn't beaten and scolded her

33:24.460 --> 33:25.540
and forced her into that bridal sedan,

33:25.860 --> 33:26.980
how could she have enjoyed

33:26.980 --> 33:29.660
a lifetime of glory as Empress of Huai?

33:30.700 --> 33:32.020
So, Wanyao,

33:32.700 --> 33:34.540
don't blame me for pushing you.

33:35.100 --> 33:36.580
Your mother is gone now.

33:37.220 --> 33:38.100
I'm your elder,

33:38.660 --> 33:39.780
and more importantly, your family.

33:41.060 --> 33:41.340
Would I...

33:41.940 --> 33:43.660
Would I ever do anything to hurt you?

34:02.460 --> 34:05.380
(Zhegui Garden)

34:09.140 --> 34:10.380
Every year, after the exam results
are announced,

34:10.980 --> 34:13.060
the successful scholars inscribe
their names at the Wild Goose Pagoda

34:13.700 --> 34:14.580
before attending a banquet here.

34:15.700 --> 34:17.220
You two should mingle

34:18.180 --> 34:19.380
and get to know your fellow graduates.

34:22.100 --> 34:23.020
There are too many people here.

34:23.340 --> 34:24.420
I will stay with you, Your Highness.

34:25.700 --> 34:26.380
Indeed.

34:27.180 --> 34:28.460
Nearly every family of officials

34:29.340 --> 34:30.500
in the capital must be here today.

34:31.300 --> 34:31.620
(Zhegui Garden)
Let's go.

34:39.460 --> 34:41.140
(Zhao Lingfei; General of the Guard's
Daughter, Yang Si's Cousin)

34:41.140 --> 34:41.740
Yang Si.

34:42.420 --> 34:43.540
Where are all the new scholars?

34:43.860 --> 34:44.820
Just follow me inside.

34:45.740 --> 34:46.820
But put that whip away first.

34:46.940 --> 34:48.380
You'll scare them all off
if you bring it in.

34:49.580 --> 34:50.300
If you ask me,

34:50.820 --> 34:51.940
you're wasting your time here.

34:52.620 --> 34:54.220
Those scholars are nothing
but bookworms.

34:54.940 --> 34:56.020
I guarantee you won't like a single one.

34:57.380 --> 34:57.700
Oh, right.

34:58.220 --> 34:59.340
Your father told me to keep an eye
on you today.

34:59.700 --> 35:00.300
Don't cause me any trouble.

35:01.740 --> 35:03.060
I'd rather choose my own husband

35:03.300 --> 35:04.540
than let my father choose for me.

35:05.180 --> 35:07.500
True heroes are hard to find these days.

35:07.780 --> 35:08.540
If any of these scholars

35:08.860 --> 35:10.260
happens to be exceptionally handsome,

35:10.620 --> 35:11.580
even if he's not much of a fighter,

35:11.780 --> 35:12.380
I could settle for him.

35:12.860 --> 35:14.780
They're the finest scholars
in the country.

35:15.140 --> 35:15.900
And you'd be settling for them?

35:26.460 --> 35:26.860
Wanyao.

35:31.660 --> 35:32.780
What are you two doing here?

35:37.420 --> 35:39.540
You must be this year's Top Scholar.

35:44.060 --> 35:45.260
They're both
top-ranked presented scholars.

35:45.700 --> 35:46.820
They have every reason to be here.

35:47.340 --> 35:49.940
What are you doing here
when you don't even study?

35:52.220 --> 35:54.060
I heard they always choose someone
handsome for third place.

35:54.500 --> 35:55.660
But you're both so good-looking.

35:55.980 --> 35:56.780
Which one came third?

36:03.900 --> 36:05.700
Yang Si, aren't you going to
introduce us?

36:05.820 --> 36:08.060
(Shouwen Pavilion)

36:08.060 --> 36:09.260
This is my younger cousin
on my mother's side,

36:09.500 --> 36:10.300
General Zhao's only daughter.

36:10.580 --> 36:11.140
Her name is Lingfei.

36:11.540 --> 36:13.100
Lingfei, pay your respects
to Princess Danyang!

36:14.780 --> 36:15.420
Greetings, Your Highness.

36:15.580 --> 36:16.460
So you're the one who...

36:19.180 --> 36:19.620
The one...

36:22.060 --> 36:22.500
The one who what?

36:23.580 --> 36:24.340
Nothing, Your Highness.

36:25.180 --> 36:26.740
Who are those two handsome gentlemen

36:26.740 --> 36:27.500
standing behind you?

36:30.220 --> 36:31.100
Why don't you ask them yourself?

36:31.580 --> 36:32.220
Why ask me?

36:33.020 --> 36:34.580
All right! What are your names?

36:36.340 --> 36:37.540
Hey! Why are you dragging me away?

36:37.660 --> 36:38.700
Neither of those two is any good.

36:38.820 --> 36:39.180
(Shouwen Pavilion)
Let's go.

36:47.980 --> 36:50.580
(Top Scholar Honors)

36:50.580 --> 36:51.940
(Top Scholar: Wei Shu)

36:51.940 --> 36:53.420
(Second Place: Li Wenqing;
Third Place: Yan Shang)

36:53.420 --> 36:55.340
(Presented Scholar:
Lin Mengran, Zhang Ruiqiu, Yu Pingjun)

36:55.340 --> 36:57.060
(Top Scholar Honors)

36:58.660 --> 37:00.860
(Top Scholar Honors)

37:05.140 --> 37:07.140
(Top Scholar Honors)

37:12.580 --> 37:15.180
(Bravo! Bravo!)

37:18.700 --> 37:19.860
(Top Scholar Honors)

37:22.500 --> 37:22.900
Here you go!

37:22.980 --> 37:24.340
(Top Scholar Honors)

37:27.460 --> 37:27.700
(Top Scholar Honors)
(What...)

37:27.700 --> 37:28.100
(Top Scholar Honors)
What's wrong?

37:29.100 --> 37:29.420
Oh...

37:32.100 --> 37:33.580
I'm so sorry! Let me see!

37:35.500 --> 37:36.180
Your face!

37:38.740 --> 37:39.860
His Majesty will be here any moment!

37:40.020 --> 37:41.940
You can't have an injured face
right now!

37:42.620 --> 37:43.860
What are we going to do?

37:44.900 --> 37:45.340
Come on! Let's go!

37:57.780 --> 37:58.420
Top Scholar.

37:58.940 --> 37:59.780
Feeling any better?

38:00.820 --> 38:02.300
We were playing a drinking game,

38:02.580 --> 38:04.140
and accidentally hurt you.

38:10.580 --> 38:12.060
I hope I didn't cause
any internal injuries.

38:12.580 --> 38:13.540
Why is your face so red?

38:15.260 --> 38:16.700
No, I'm fine.

38:17.620 --> 38:18.500
Please don't worry about me, Miss.

38:18.940 --> 38:19.820
How could I not?

38:19.980 --> 38:20.820
You're the Top Scholar!

38:21.140 --> 38:22.820
If anything happens to you,
I'll never hear the end of it.

38:27.460 --> 38:28.820
(Look how spoiled and arrogant she is!)

38:29.340 --> 38:30.340
(Does she look like a fallen woman?)

38:31.020 --> 38:32.340
(Whether she looks it or not,
she is one.)

38:32.500 --> 38:33.420
Appearing in public is nothing!

38:33.660 --> 38:34.100
I heard

38:34.620 --> 38:35.660
that when she was in North Jing...

38:36.660 --> 38:37.260
(I heard)

38:37.820 --> 38:39.060
(this year's top scholar)

38:39.580 --> 38:41.060
(is one of her male favorites!)

38:42.020 --> 38:42.740
(Really? Is that true?)

38:43.620 --> 38:44.420
(You haven't heard?)

38:44.860 --> 38:46.060
(The third-place scholar)

38:46.420 --> 38:48.140
(is always coming and going
from her residence.)

38:50.180 --> 38:52.340
(Who knew she was
such a promiscuous widow?)

38:54.060 --> 38:54.700
Are you angry?

38:54.940 --> 38:55.700
Are you going to fight them?

38:55.700 --> 38:56.420
(You even know about that?)

38:56.420 --> 38:56.900
Want me to do it?

38:56.900 --> 38:57.420
(I had no idea!)

38:57.860 --> 38:58.940
(Look at her! Who's she trying to fool?)

39:00.020 --> 39:01.020
(Who would've thought?)

39:01.020 --> 39:01.500
I can't beat them.

39:01.660 --> 39:02.580
(Come on, let's drink!)

39:05.740 --> 39:07.500
You're quite handsome yourself.

39:07.980 --> 39:09.700
Why don't you become
one of their male favorites?

39:09.700 --> 39:10.340
What do you say?

39:10.780 --> 39:11.860
(I wish I could!)

39:12.060 --> 39:13.340
(But she wouldn't give me
a second look!)

39:13.820 --> 39:15.820
(You've got a point!)

39:17.100 --> 39:18.100
(She may be promiscuous,)

39:18.460 --> 39:19.660
(but she's certainly beautiful...)

39:19.980 --> 39:21.020
(Fire! There's a fire over here!)

39:22.420 --> 39:23.020
(Mr. Zhen! You're on fire!)

39:23.180 --> 39:23.700
(Move! Get out of the way!)

39:23.940 --> 39:24.380
(Are you all right?)

39:24.580 --> 39:25.500
Where did that strange fire come from?

39:26.060 --> 39:26.900
How did it suddenly catch fire?

39:26.900 --> 39:27.460
Is your backside all right?

39:29.260 --> 39:30.180
You know magic?

39:30.660 --> 39:31.300
It's not magic.

39:32.060 --> 39:33.380
I promise I won't tell anyone.

39:34.540 --> 39:35.420
It's no secret.

39:35.820 --> 39:36.820
Then can I ask you something?

39:37.420 --> 39:38.380
What they said isn't true.

39:42.100 --> 39:43.100
Her Highness is a good person.

39:43.540 --> 39:44.500
She doesn't deserve to be spoken
of that way.

39:47.060 --> 39:49.100
I thought you were angry because

39:49.100 --> 39:50.260
they were gossiping about you.

39:51.780 --> 39:53.060
Then can I ask you another question?

39:54.180 --> 39:54.580
What is it?

39:55.540 --> 39:56.660
That magic trick you just did...

39:56.740 --> 39:57.580
Could you teach me?

39:58.460 --> 40:00.180
I promise I won't use it
for anything bad!

40:03.140 --> 40:03.820
It's not magic.

40:04.380 --> 40:04.860
It's this.

40:06.700 --> 40:07.940
What kind of magical treasure is that?

40:09.260 --> 40:10.180
I'm not sure.

40:11.140 --> 40:12.100
How can you not know?

40:12.300 --> 40:13.260
Did you just pick it up somewhere?

40:13.620 --> 40:14.500
I made it myself.

40:15.180 --> 40:16.820
I just haven't thought of a name for it.

40:17.540 --> 40:18.340
That's amazing!

40:20.060 --> 40:20.780
It's just an unconventional
little trick.

40:21.300 --> 40:21.820
Nothing impressive.

40:22.860 --> 40:23.660
Are you kidding?

40:24.060 --> 40:25.980
There have been countless top scholars
throughout history.

40:26.420 --> 40:27.060
But how many of them

40:27.060 --> 40:28.620
could make a little stone
that works magic?

40:29.340 --> 40:31.500
What's so hard about reading books
and writing essays?

40:32.020 --> 40:33.780
If I had enough money and free time,

40:34.340 --> 40:35.700
I could even teach my dog to read.

40:40.260 --> 40:41.300
(Hurry! The banquet's starting!)

40:41.420 --> 40:41.940
(His Majesty has arrived!)

41:01.500 --> 41:04.100
I personally selected you three
as the top-three scholars.

41:04.820 --> 41:05.300
Well?

41:06.140 --> 41:07.780
Has the success gone to your heads?

41:09.620 --> 41:10.300
You may all rise.

41:12.180 --> 41:13.060
Thank you, Your Majesty.

41:21.660 --> 41:24.020
The Top Scholar looks so composed,

41:24.740 --> 41:26.940
yet he's still a reckless young man.

41:27.500 --> 41:28.460
It's only been a few days.

41:28.820 --> 41:29.940
What happened to your face?

41:32.540 --> 41:33.420
Forgive my improper appearance,
Your Majesty.

41:33.980 --> 41:34.900
I deserve Your Majesty's punishment.

41:37.620 --> 41:38.220
Father,

41:38.580 --> 41:40.180
who would dare injure his face?

41:41.140 --> 41:41.860
If you ask me,

41:42.220 --> 41:45.060
it only makes Wei Shu
more charmingly youthful.

41:47.820 --> 41:48.180
Yes.

41:48.660 --> 41:49.340
Charming indeed.

41:52.780 --> 41:53.540
Third-Place Scholar,

41:54.700 --> 41:56.100
you come from a farming family,

41:57.220 --> 41:58.700
without a single official
among your relatives.

41:59.700 --> 42:02.900
That's even rarer than coming first
in the exams.

42:05.820 --> 42:06.660
Your Majesty is too kind.

42:08.340 --> 42:10.620
You were living as a farmer in Lingnan.

42:11.100 --> 42:12.300
Why come all the way to Sheng'an

42:13.020 --> 42:13.940
to take the imperial exams?

42:14.540 --> 42:15.100
Your Majesty,

42:15.540 --> 42:17.100
precisely because I am a commoner,

42:17.620 --> 42:18.540
born among the fields

42:18.780 --> 42:19.620
and raised in the countryside,

42:20.340 --> 42:21.500
with a life worth no more than dust,

42:21.900 --> 42:23.060
I sought a place in Your Majesty's court

42:23.620 --> 42:24.420
to serve the people

42:25.020 --> 42:25.820
and be of use to Your Majesty.

42:31.580 --> 42:32.460
Well said!

42:33.540 --> 42:35.020
All lands under heaven
belong to the Emperor.

42:35.580 --> 42:37.220
Even a talented man from distant Lingnan

42:37.620 --> 42:38.060
can still

42:38.820 --> 42:40.340
find his way into Father's service!

42:48.620 --> 42:50.620
Do you have a wife back home?

42:51.820 --> 42:52.380
Your Majesty,

42:53.060 --> 42:53.500
I do not.

42:54.580 --> 42:55.420
What do you think

42:56.740 --> 42:58.500
of my daughter, Princess Danyang?

43:07.820 --> 43:12.620
(Next Episode Preview)

43:12.860 --> 43:13.620
Third-Place Scholar,

43:14.540 --> 43:15.460
come to my residence

43:15.900 --> 43:17.100
and help me with a few questions.

43:17.300 --> 43:18.060
Forgive me, Your Highness.

43:18.740 --> 43:19.780
Isn't this the umbrella you gave him?

43:19.980 --> 43:20.660
Why did he leave it here?

43:21.420 --> 43:22.700
Do you know where Yan Shang went?

43:23.780 --> 43:24.900
He never breaks his promises.

43:25.020 --> 43:25.980
Where could he have gone?

43:29.241 --> 43:32.534
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

43:35.219 --> 43:40.135
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

43:42.329 --> 43:48.174
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

43:48.674 --> 43:53.900
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

43:56.669 --> 44:01.460
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

44:02.296 --> 44:08.375
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

44:10.176 --> 44:13.326
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

44:13.326 --> 44:14.974
♪Burning bright as a song♪

44:15.026 --> 44:18.750
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

44:19.128 --> 44:23.794
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

44:24.413 --> 44:28.454
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

44:28.945 --> 44:31.060
♪Not a single hour less♪

44:31.100 --> 44:38.046
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

44:38.809 --> 44:42.262
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

44:42.442 --> 44:45.587
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

44:46.026 --> 44:52.663
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

44:53.060 --> 44:55.098
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

44:55.098 --> 44:57.574
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

44:57.612 --> 45:00.081
♪You're the only one I need♪

45:00.285 --> 45:07.172
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

45:07.484 --> 45:10.755
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

45:11.060 --> 45:14.233
♪My last untouched innocence♪

45:14.557 --> 45:17.983
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

45:18.216 --> 45:21.441
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

45:21.772 --> 45:28.568
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

45:28.937 --> 45:30.999
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

45:31.000 --> 45:33.503
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

45:33.550 --> 45:35.888
♪You're the only one I need♪

45:36.119 --> 45:42.954
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

45:43.303 --> 45:44.921
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

45:45.051 --> 45:46.847
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

45:47.204 --> 45:50.221
♪You're the only one I need♪

45:50.261 --> 45:51.588
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
